      "text": "### Engineering Bridge: The Harmonic Series as Fourier Decomposition"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#016",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
