      "text": "```\nMUSICAL CONCEPT                  SIGNAL PROCESSING EQUIVALENT\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nHarmonic series (partials)       Fourier series of a periodic waveform\n  f₀, 2f₀, 3f₀, ...            → any periodic signal = Σ aₙ sin(nωt + φₙ)"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#017",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
