      "text": "Consonance (sounds \"pure\")       Shared spectral components reinforce\n  3:2 fifth: every 3rd partial   → partials coincide, no beating\n  of upper note = every 2nd\n  of lower note"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#019",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
